  "roles_note": "start_role mission: taps release at max(release[p], S + release[p]); start_role bootstrap: taps (and core resets with role bootstrap) release at release[p] (raw delivered wavefront, boot runs before START), the local START tap start_t<start_tap> at S + release[p] gates the contents' declared mission admission.  One START, no timer, no die-reset bypass.",
